{"id":"eindeutig","lemma":"eindeutig","pos":"adv","rank":1729,"glosses":["unambiguously","clearly, obviously"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/76/De-eindeutig.ogg/De-eindeutig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das war eindeutig ein Scherz.","en":"That was definitely a joke.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"joke"}]},{"text":"Sie war eindeutig zufrieden mit den Ergebnissen.","en":"She was clearly satisfied with the results.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"satisfied"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"result","l":"Ergebnis"}]},{"text":"Tom braucht eindeutig Hilfe.","en":"Tom clearly needs help.","words":[null,{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},null,{"g":"the act of helping"}]},{"text":"Meine Anweisungen waren eindeutig.","en":"My instructions were clear.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"directive, order","l":"Anweisung"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Es ist eindeutig, dass du falsch liegst.","en":"It's clear that you're wrong.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"false"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"}]}]}